agent wrote this migration for me. adds region onto orders so the regional dashboards don't need the join to customers. ran clean on my laptop db. postgres. the orders table in prod is big-ish, don't know the exact size. top 3 things i should worry about before i run it friday?

```sql
ALTER TABLE orders ADD COLUMN region_code VARCHAR(2) NOT NULL;

UPDATE orders
SET region_code = (SELECT region FROM customers WHERE customers.id = orders.customer_id);

CREATE INDEX idx_orders_region ON orders(region_code);
```
